#
# What `docker build` (deploy/Dockerfile) does not get: secrets and runtime data never enter an image or its build
# cache, the web stage installs its own packages (those of the host may be built for another C library), and
# without .git the Go build does not ask git (absent from the build image) for the version control state.
.git
**/node_modules
/bin/
/dist/
/data/
/docs/
/migration-work/
internal/webui/dist/
web/dist-showcase/
web/coverage/
e2e/test-results/
e2e/playwright-report/
e2e/.auth/
deploy/secrets/
deploy/backups/
deploy/data/
deploy/.env
.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
